{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梵蒂岡教廷表示，教宗良十四世計劃今日入院，準備做肺結節切除手術。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAT.POPE-0700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026V8HAfCGxpL1791848450.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>在芝加哥聖名主教座堂，當地總教區神父卡梅利帶領天主教徒，為教宗良十四世祝禱，祈求上主向他及醫生賜予力量，以堅定信念面對疾病。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAT.POPE-0700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026H4sKUl5ZSI1791848453.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>梵蒂岡教廷表示，教宗今日會在羅馬傑梅利綜合醫院留醫，準備切除肺結節。他日前接受例行身體檢查，發現肺部有一處較細小，屬早期、尚未擴散的結節，預計住院約一星期。有神父指聖伯多祿廣場將於周三舉行彌撒聖祭，屆時會特別為教宗的健康祈禱。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:19:56.600617+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:18:19.178511+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:50.346739+00:00","content_hash":"9e271111a6b87670ce3946d621459c5421b178e8586467b1e79c82dec260bc32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}